WEBVTT

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:18.000
♪ Rudolph the Red-Nosed Reindeer ♪

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:33.000
♪ Had a very shiny nose ♪

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:48.000
♪ And if you ever saw it ♪

00:00:48.000 --> 00:01:02.000
♪ You would even say it glows ♪

00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:20.000
'Twas the day before Christmas.
The reindeer were playing in the hills.

00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:38.000
They were skating and climbing,
and decorating a Christmas tree.

00:01:38.000 --> 00:01:50.000
Look! A shiny red nose!
It is Rudolph!

00:01:50.000 --> 00:02:10.000
The reindeer laughed at Rudolph.
"Go on home, red nose!"

00:02:10.000 --> 00:02:30.000
Rudolph was very sad.
He ran home to his mother.

00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:48.000
"Hang your stocking, Rudolph.
Santa will come tonight."

00:02:48.000 --> 00:03:12.000
Rudolph went to bed,
but his little red nose was shining.

00:03:12.000 --> 00:03:34.000
Far away, at the North Pole,
Santa looked at the sky.

00:03:34.000 --> 00:03:52.000
"Oh, no! A heavy fog!
How can I see the way?"

00:03:52.000 --> 00:04:10.000
"Dasher! Dancer! Prancer! Vixen!
Comet! Cupid! Donner! Blitzen!"

00:04:10.000 --> 00:04:28.000
"Let's go, my reindeer!
We must bring the gifts to the children!"

00:04:28.000 --> 00:04:45.000
But the fog was too heavy.
They could not see the way.

00:04:45.000 --> 00:05:05.000
Crash! They hit the trees!
Santa's sleigh was stuck.

00:05:05.000 --> 00:05:30.000
"This fog is terrible!
What can we do?"

00:05:30.000 --> 00:05:55.000
Then Santa saw a little red light
in a small house.

00:05:55.000 --> 00:06:15.000
It was Rudolph's nose!
"Rudolph, will you help me?"

00:06:15.000 --> 00:06:30.000
"Of course, Santa!"
Rudolph left a note for his parents.

00:06:30.000 --> 00:06:52.000
And Rudolph ran in front of the team,
with his bright red nose.

00:06:52.000 --> 00:07:12.000
Now Santa could see everything!
They visited every house.

00:07:12.000 --> 00:07:35.000
Hooray! Rudolph saved Christmas!
Everyone shouted, "Welcome, Rudolph!"

00:07:35.000 --> 00:07:55.000
"You are a hero, Rudolph!"
And Rudolph smiled and blushed.

00:07:55.000 --> 00:08:12.000
♪ Then how the reindeer loved him ♪

00:08:12.000 --> 00:08:30.000
♪ As they shouted out with glee ♪

00:08:30.000 --> 00:08:43.000
♪ Rudolph the Red-Nosed Reindeer ♪
♪ You'll go down in history! ♪
